  "dashboards": [
    {
      "name": "LABORATORIO PATOLOGIA",
      "source_file": "17 Documentacion Tablero Laboratorio Patologias.docx",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Presenta un gráfico de líneas que muestra el reporte de datos de patología en un periodo anual, con este reporte se puede observar los índices de prestación de servicio con los reportes de patología.",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Para realizar este tablero se utilizó la siguiente consulta:",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "SELECT",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ADNINGRESO.AINCONSEC AS Consecutivo,",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "GENPACIEN.GPANOMCOM AS Paciente,",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "HCNSOLPAT.HCSFECSOL AS FechaSolicitud,",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 8,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "HCNRESPAT.HCRFECRES AS FechaRealizado,",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 9,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Resultados.CodigoExamen AS CodigoLaboratorio,",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 10,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "GENSERIPS.SIPNOMBRE AS TipoLaboratorio,",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 11,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "HCNRESPAT.HCRDESCRIP AS ResultadoLaboratorio,",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 12,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "GENTERCER.TERNOMCOM AS Aseguradora,",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 13,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "CASE GENDETCON.GDECONFAC",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 14,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "WHEN 125 THEN 'MEDICINA PREPAGADA'",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 15,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "WHEN 126 THEN 'POLIZA'",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 16,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "WHEN 127 THEN 'PARTICULAR'",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 17,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "WHEN 122 THEN 'PLAN COMPLEMENTARIO'",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 18,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ELSE 'CONTRIBUTIVO/SUBSIDIADA'",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 19,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "END AS CategoriaEPS",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 20,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "FROM DGempres10..HCNSOLPAT",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 21,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "INNER JOIN LabPatologico..Resultados ON Resultados.Oid = (",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 22,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "SELECT TOP 1 Oid",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 23,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "FROM LabPatologico..Resultados R",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 24,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "WHERE R.Solicitud = HCNSOLPAT.OID",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 25,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ORDER BY R.Oid ASC",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 26,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": ")",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 27,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "INNER JOIN DGempres10..ADNINGRESO ON HCNSOLPAT.ADNINGRESO = ADNINGRESO.OID",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 28,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "INNER JOIN DGempres10..GENPACIEN ON ADNINGRESO.GENPACIEN = GENPACIEN.OID",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 29,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "INNER JOIN DGempres10..GENDETCON ON GENDETCON.OID = ADNINGRESO.GENDETCON",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 30,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "LEFT JOIN DGempres10..GENTERCER ON GENTERCER.OID = GENDETCON.GENTERCER1",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 31,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "LEFT JOIN DGempres10..GENSERIPS ON GENSERIPS.OID = HCNSOLPAT.GENSERIPS",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 32,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "INNER JOIN DGempres10..HCNRESPAT ON HCNRESPAT.OID = (",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 33,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "SELECT TOP 1 OID",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 34,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "FROM DGempres10..HCNRESPAT HR",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 35,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "WHERE HR.HCNSOLPAT = HCNSOLPAT.OID",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 36,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ORDER BY HR.OID ASC",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 37,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": ")",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 38,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "WHERE",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 39,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Resultados.Estado IN (1, 2, 3)",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 40,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "AND HCNSOLPAT.HCSFECSOL BETWEEN '2025-01-01' AND CAST(GETDATE() AS DATE)",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 41,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ORDER BY",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 42,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "HCNSOLPAT.HCSFECSOL DESC",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 44,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "DESCRIPCION DE LAS VISUALIZACIONES",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 46,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Filtros",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 47,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Muestran la información de los gráficos de línea dependiendo la selección realizada, ya sea por aseguradora, año, mes o el tipo de patología.",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 50,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Gráfico de Total de Reportes",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 52,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Muestra en un gráfico de líneas el comportamiento de los reportes de patología.",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 55,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Tabla de Reportes de Patología",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 56,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Muestra el conteo de los reportes mensuales y su histórico de datos.",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 60,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Indicadores de Reportes de Patología",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 62,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Muestra el conteo de reportes de patología anual y su promedio mensual.",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 65,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Botón de Asegurador",
          "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "index": 66,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Redirecciona a un reporte anexo que muestra la información de la cantidad de laboratorios patológicos realizados por aseguradora.",
          "style": "Normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
